@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131

### Get all locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments

### Get one locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/1

### Create a shipment item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Order_Id": 1,
    "Shipment_Date": "2024-06-01T00:00:00Z",
    "Shipment_Type": "Standard",
    "Carrier_Name": "FedEx",
    "Shipping_Method": "Ground",
    "Payment_Type": "Prepaid"
}

### Delete a shipment item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/2